[@22]
<h2>~lYou</h2>
<p>
Come on!  It is now or never!

[@25]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
Lets do this!

[@30]
<h2>~rGeneral Dusty</h2>
<p>
At last a challange, but it will be us who shall emerge from this battle victorious.

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Through the Darkening Skies</h2> 
<i>"You can either win the greatest of battles, or die trying."<br>
--Handbook of War</i>
<p>It appears as if Lord Gunton sent his 3 most trusted allies to stop your quest.  Break through this opposition or else you shall perish.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>
You have defeated Lord Gunton's best servants!  Your victory shall not be that far away now!
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b10

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>~rGeneral Dusty</h2>
<p>
May the winds of nimbus tear you apart!

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
Im under attack!

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Rain Wizard,  you lost your right flank and the enemy looped around you and you died.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Wind Knight,  you were greatly outnumbered and soon perished.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>~sCaptain Foreway</h2>
<p>
Grah!!!!  Die you fools!

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>~ySargent Drizzle</h2>
<p>
You will soon be down to your knees as well.

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have died in battle and what happened to your allies is irrelevant, but they probally died.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
